                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "f(x)=\\begin{cases}-2x-1&x<-2,\\\\3&-2\\le x<1,\\\\2x+1&x\\ge1.\\end{cases}",
                    "display": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p127-q73-a-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Split at ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "x=-2",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "x=1",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", where the arguments change sign.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "The arguments change sign at $x=-2$ and $x=1$.\n\nFor $x<-2$, both arguments are negative:\n$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=-(x-1)-(x+2)\\\\f(x)&=-2x-1.\\end{align*}$$\n\nFor $-2\\le x<1$, $x-1<0$ and $x+2\\ge0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=-(x-1)+(x+2)\\\\f(x)&=3.\\end{align*}$$\n\nFor $x\\ge1$, both arguments are nonnegative:\n$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=(x-1)+(x+2)\\\\f(x)&=2x+1.\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}-2x-1&x<-2,\\\\3&-2\\le x<1,\\\\2x+1&x\\ge1.\\end{cases}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 84
